1. ENCRYPTED POSTGRESQL ENGINE CONNECTION STRINGS
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://db_user:db_password@your_rwanda_host:5432/terrawatch_db

2. RS256 JWT ASYMMETRIC AUTHENTICATION LIFECYCLES
JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=./private_key.pem
JWT_PUBLIC_KEY_PATH=./public_key.pemToken validation lifespan constraint in minutes 

3. Token validation lifespan constraint in minutes 
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=5

4. IDENTITY PROTECTION & SYSTEM BRUTE-FORCE CONTROLS
MAX_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS_PER_MINUTE=2
MAX_FAILED_ATTEMPTS_BEFORE_LOCKOUT=5
ACCOUNT_LOCKOUT_DURATION_MINUTES=15

5. Core API rate-limiting thresholds
RATE_LIMIT_API_CALLS_PER_USER_PER_HOUR=1000

Remote-sensing ingestion access credentials (e.g., NASA CHIRPS streams)
CHIRPS_SATELLITE_STREAM_URL=https://nasa.gov
REMOTE_SENSING_PROVIDER_API_KEY=your_protected_satellite_provider_token_here